  "review": "ESI=this and interface=ESI+40. DBDF00 fade2.0/0; DBE0C0 music46; DBE11D hero,false,false; DBE13E time12.0; DBE14B sleepingfalse. DBE17D house lookup output stack18 with HerosOldHouse name. DBE198 override same Thing,true and DBE1A8 doors same Thing. GetActiveQuestName hidden return consumes only its output: DBE1CA screen(name,false,true); DBE247 fade0.5/0; DBE264 hero,true,false; DBE271 sleepingtrue; DBE295 completion(name,false,false,false); DBE2BE deferreddeactivation(name,0). Full function pins staging and control order. Native string/Thing ownership remains separate. Native SetTimeAsStopped passes parent4C; existing LuaQuestState forwards the per-instance m_stopTimeIndex address on both stop and resume.",
